-- 처치 보상: 경험치(파티면 PartySystem이 근처 파티원에게 나눈다) + 드롭(개인 전리품, 처치자 기준). (MonsterKilled 구독)
@Logic
script RewardSystem extends Logic

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void OnBeginPlay()
        _GameEvents:Subscribe("MonsterKilled", "RewardSystem", function(e) self:OnMonsterKilled(e) end)
    end

    @ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
    method void OnMonsterKilled(table e)
        local player = e.player
        if player == nil then return end
        if not _PartySystem:ShareKill(player, e.monster, e.level, e.grade) then
            ---@type PlayerStats
            local stats = player:GetComponent("script.PlayerStats")
            if stats ~= nil then stats:GainExp(stats:ExpForKill(e.level, e.grade)) end
        end
        -- 소환 중인 그림자도 처치 경험치를 나눠 받아 레벨이 오른다
        ---@type PlayerStats
        local killer = player:GetComponent("script.PlayerStats")
        ---@type ShadowOwner
        local owner = player:GetComponent("script.ShadowOwner")
        if killer ~= nil and owner ~= nil then owner:GainKillExp(e.level, e.grade) end
        _LootSystem:RollDrops(e.monster, e.level, e.rank, player)
    end

end
